# Running instructions for Equipredict-B

This document describes how to run the Equipredict-B Docker image for equilibrium calculation.

## 1. Requirements

Please install Docker before running the calculation.

- Windows: Docker Desktop
- macOS: Docker Desktop
- Linux: Docker Engine

No Python installation is required.

## 2. Download the Docker image archive

Download the Docker image archive from the Baidu Netdisk link provided in `README.md`.

Expected file name:

```text
equipredict-b_1.0.tar
